  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.161` to `4.1.163`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.161...application_builder_helpers/4.1.163)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): required valued options consume flag-looking neighbors (Fixes #698) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/719\n* fix(cli): wire SetHelpBorderWidth into help layout (Fixes #720) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/721\n* Bump Microsoft.AspNetCore.SignalR.Common from 10.0.12 to 10.0.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/722\n* Bump System.Security.Cryptography.Xml from 10.0.12 to 10.0.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/723\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20261015160744.9f6e1d6...build.20261016054613.0035e2e",
